<header class="vb-cost-head"><div><a class="back-link" href="<?=e(app_url('dream-trip.php?id='.$tripId.'&workspace=costs'))?>">← Trip workspace</a><span class="eyebrow">Trip Cost Intelligence · True Trip Economics</span><h1>What the trip really costs — before, during and after disruption.</h1><p>Vacation Brain separates planned budget, booked spend, actual expenses, disruption costs, recovered cash and provider credits so one number does not hide what actually happened.</p></div><div class="vb-cost-head-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="<?=e(app_url('trip-bookings.php?id='.$tripId))?>">Bookings</a><a class="button secondary" href="<?=e(app_url('trip-resolution.php?id='.$tripId))?>">Resolution</a><a class="button secondary" href="<?=e(app_url('trip-memory.php?id='.$tripId))?>">Trip Memory</a></div></header>
