<section class="vb-cost-card"><span class="vb-cost-kicker">Learned trip-cost model</span><h2>Your completed trips are becoming a cost baseline.</h2><?php if(!$model):?><p>Complete Trip Memory with actual spend and learning enabled to start building a currency-specific cost model.</p><?php else:?><div class="vb-cost-model"><article><span>Samples</span><strong><?=(int)$model['samples']?> completed trips</strong></article><article><span>Average trip cost</span><strong><?=e(vb_cost_money($model['average_trip_cost'],$tripCurrency))?></strong></article><article><span>Average / traveler / day</span><strong><?=e(vb_cost_money($model['average_per_traveler_day'],$tripCurrency))?></strong></article><article><span>Average budget variance</span><strong><?=($model['average_budget_variance_pct']??null)===null?'—':e((string)$model['average_budget_variance_pct']).'%'?></strong></article><article><span>Disruption overhead</span><strong><?=e((string)$model['disruption_overhead_pct'])?>%</strong></article><article><span>Cash recovery rate</span><strong><?=e((string)$model['cash_recovery_rate_pct'])?>%</strong></article></div><div class="vb-cost-chips"><?php foreach($model['top_categories']??[] as $cat):?><span><?=e((string)$cat['label'])?> · <?=e((string)$cat['share_pct'])?>%</span><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($snapshot['economics']['forecast'])):$f=$snapshot['economics']['forecast'];?><div class="vb-cost-notice"><strong>Historical estimate:</strong> <?=e(vb_cost_money($f['estimated_trip_cost'],$f['currency']))?> for this trip shape, based on <?=(int)$f['samples']?> prior sample<?=((int)$f['samples']===1?'':'s')?>. This is not a quote.</div><?php endif;?></section>
